# Fuzzy Information Retrieval Using Genetic Algorithms and Relevance Feedback.

**Authors:** Petry, Frederick E., And Others

## Abstract
Describes an approach that combines concepts from information retrieval, fuzzy set theory, and genetic programing to improve weighted Boolean query formulation via relevance feedback. Highlights include background on information retrieval systems; genetic algorithms; subproblem formulation; and preliminary results based on a testbed. (Contains 12 references.) (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ473015

